stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> DRAFT
    DRAFT --> VALIDATED: valid public input
    VALIDATED --> PLANNED: approved planning call
    PLANNED --> AWAITING_APPROVAL
    AWAITING_APPROVAL --> QUEUED: exact plan and budget approved
    QUEUED --> RUNNING: durable lease
    RUNNING --> REPORTING: finished or bounded stop
    REPORTING --> COMPLETED: all required outputs supported
    REPORTING --> PARTIAL: missing evidence or optional failures
    RUNNING --> BLOCKED: missing permission or unresolved provider state
    BLOCKED --> QUEUED: authorized recovery
    RUNNING --> FAILED: unrecoverable error
    QUEUED --> CANCELLED: user cancellation
    RUNNING --> CANCELLED: pending work stopped
    COMPLETED --> [*]
    PARTIAL --> [*]
    FAILED --> [*]
    CANCELLED --> [*]
